    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c01ab8cbd188835fdb15990f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她自觉不能就此消沉，\n于是重振旗鼓，打算重新自我锻炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6aa30fe4c919a5ea6f874b4c503d529a764dfd7fdadb21d1389e3519361e84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02abc9557023279a393da939",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbcafb38d7ebe3c444fb916b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩看着她的背影，对她暗自表达了\n感谢与决心──谢谢她愿意认真跟自己对决，\n并且自己以后同样不会输给她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99c94c16f341b6b3cbc322a71c5aee9c21ccec2e841a55cb7730d2b89bad82c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f72ae90c46af7cfcf42bbf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29c09fc59c0ae1938cda01de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接着……下一个目标是“天皇赏（春）”。\n目白麦昆斗志高昂，打算拿出自己所有实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da71ec9611984e9929bfb61017c945bfe7aea788d46deffb36e066ae31b3de69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d499ad647fc9df904fe9455",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・深切反省并前进",
      "source_fingerprint": "67dfba938668e0ce87cc5cbc868b8a8a6455e213c149ef37f3e48ab35ef5f986",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab8dbefd218d1485c928d6a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆压制住目白赖恩及其他对手们，\n如愿达成她的夙愿，称霸了“天皇赏（春）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b226dd8d2e241a8d6d94e236a806f1cf86d7ce5eb12fb3618057b687d5dc85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae81097e2f5fb337113f36e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她内心怀抱着各种情感，\n向目白家的成员们报告自己获胜一事，\n并对他们表达了感谢之意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f8f9788c1ff317ee8287ffe18d704d989160041f2e8ce45e26e4fa96a01ee9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d843b64888852b69f32ef9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众们听到她的发言，纷纷替她叫好，\n欢呼声更是持续了好一阵子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d920b943386b1b7dad96b12551f92122a2f177bf26a893a3310baa42a92b6322",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f157ae2dfc51a745acb0d479",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（春）结束后・达成夙愿",
      "source_fingerprint": "30b5bd303bf836a2b75400e1a76cace22a194ac001432f6e1031e13be692ef3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf083f1ee1a965da8b49eddb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”赛事中的目白家对决──\n这场激战是由目白麦昆展现了强大实力，\n并夺得优胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1998a6457381347ed4d8a719e3d3dfeeca4e6f137b1d849b1ece802fef1415e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:590d01ce3bc5f004980befc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们两人的激战让观众们赞扬不已，\n“宝冢纪念”就这样在观众的欢呼声中落幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2823ac918d5de48f6acc4bca4245c1a8a5d5d967486a754596f56580256d2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89886939fbb40f2b08c97eae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接着──经过“宝冢纪念”的激战后，\n目白麦昆订下了新的目标，\n那就是要称霸秋季“天皇赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3806122742cb86726d4f0083364bbd1e238f1af265397d3b5e14b7f1bc974fa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef69f826e2f90c18e4cbcf12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至今目白家未曾有人达成过\n“春秋天皇赏连霸”这项创举，\n而她已朝着这个目标迈步向前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff39530c1b0f052f02034c5af7bf67889a7d2b6d9638ccc79648cd52720e9835",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a237a59279f0faf99c88a22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・目白的强大",
      "source_fingerprint": "9180618d3905da22859aad5157beeb3b96cd88bf824c81cf3820c54d6d1f9d9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e290cf7be181224540aa47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”赛事中的目白家对决──\n这场激战是由目白赖恩展现了强烈决心，\n并夺得优胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3194b9ed9c96b195ee50f9c0c4d6bc49b0a97c26489f99303a54e62fe3160c95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37ed06cb374c0afb3b46c96e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这场与目白赖恩的对决中，\n目白麦昆才发现自己的决心\n依然还过于天真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc53b281c7619303eaa1a9d4653fbcca0e04d2b4d4c7b14dcd2e2d3a408408ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7f0c2e5b1a768214351a70c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接着──经过“宝冢纪念”的激战后，\n目白麦昆订下了新的目标，\n那就是要称霸秋季“天皇赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3806122742cb86726d4f0083364bbd1e238f1af265397d3b5e14b7f1bc974fa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1fa93c7d36fc0518b0e80bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至今目白家未曾有人达成过\n“春秋天皇赏连霸”这项创举，\n而她已朝着这个目标迈步向前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff39530c1b0f052f02034c5af7bf67889a7d2b6d9638ccc79648cd52720e9835",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4cdaeb8bc9db85cccda6af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・牢记决心",
      "source_fingerprint": "54fdf2ccacecb1de579f375dd3c6d14fcaf2714ecb04f98c990848a0320979de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dda03163562edb1301c8e4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋季的澄净天空下，\n响彻着庆祝目白麦昆得胜的热烈欢呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "673181ab411b471d12429ba30de4e5e59b4317fc8d4d6788fa7a6a17ac277c11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfa65817897009e686b0efe0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观众们、训练员，以及目白家的成员们，\n许多人纷纷向她献上祝贺，\n使她内心有着言语无法形容的喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7428c706653f40b957e2593da91ce5eccfdfadfd4d850e85e7eb929177f6a8f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e420c121cbb9533130c6747",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然过去偶尔会感到迷惘、痛苦……\n但她坚持下去，持续奔跑──",
      "source_fingerprint": "37c5852dbbcd09d2933a8945ad6d5fa8c6201d577eae2c9a7d29048f3bf1436c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c649828fcad840ec59c8da4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是终于创下了\n连名门目白家也是首次达成的创举……\n“春秋天皇赏连霸”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6373fee28d9f511f98437e51f9f7a5c29f90c9b20c7697f2fee3ea210caf1c4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71cd2dc9ab670ab5bf4937a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・前人未及的荣耀",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2bd5297d1b24a4f15d1d6397f068a92a80d3e3d09a8170882f5be10fb53d92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
