    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c939254721af176cddd3d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”赛事中的目白家对决──\n这场激战是由目白麦昆展现了强大实力，\n打败了目白赖恩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79e62d837e9228c92cf8332bd2a9949b2df1fe05a7275577fd983f4117f5fa9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c44dcd1e518dfb961f777fc0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们两人的激战让观众们赞扬不已，\n“宝冢纪念”就这样在观众的欢呼声中落幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab2823ac918d5de48f6acc4bca4245c1a8a5d5d967486a754596f56580256d2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aabd0beffc7a25ffb8f5b67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接着──经过“宝冢纪念”的激战后，\n目白麦昆订下了新的目标，\n那就是要称霸秋季“天皇赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3806122742cb86726d4f0083364bbd1e238f1af265397d3b5e14b7f1bc974fa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82ac745694dceb094ab27405",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "至今目白家未曾有人达成过\n“春秋天皇赏连霸”这项创举，\n而她已朝着这个目标迈步向前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff39530c1b0f052f02034c5af7bf67889a7d2b6d9638ccc79648cd52720e9835",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b2876703d11b8e298e0a686",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・目白的强大",
      "source_fingerprint": "9180618d3905da22859aad5157beeb3b96cd88bf824c81cf3820c54d6d1f9d9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
