      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a20c664af144aa60b038d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她诉说起自己对“天皇赏”的想法……\n她想在祖父母充满回忆的赛事中得胜，\n并想获得身为长途跑者的荣耀──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2599dbd4cf1d39ed4692542dbd40d367db8e501a540f3d0f27d78ea577c9070",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c40645d0ca105fc51af6509f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她振奋精神，决定要好好运用\n春天来临前的时间，更加琢磨自己的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebf1978ae18f7f328305bd4ac852a59595b2d8254d46171ed9cd1693676a2974",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
